    "description": "Video Tour! 3437 & 3439 Fillmore was built in 1936 & reimagined in 2020. These two, custom 3 bed, 3.5 bath homes are built with exceptional design & finish.? Enter the building through a custom gate & into the building lobby with hardwood floors. Enter the lower home, 3437 & appreciate the open floor plan. The kitchen is designed to live, cook & entertain. The Living room has a wet bar & wood burning fireplace. Dining room opens to the side patio. Laundry closet & powder room. The 2 beds on the main floor have custom baths en suite. The master Downstairs is quiet, private & opens to the yard. 3439 is up 1 flight of sky-lit stairs. The open kitchen & dining room is perfect for everyday living and formal dining. Work from home and then the office disappears when the workday ends. The living room has vaulted ceiling & wood burning fireplace. Laundry room and powder room. The 2 beds on the main floor have custom baths en suite. The master bedroom floor upstairs is glorious & light."
  },
